  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Kenya Hospital Association (KHA) Medical Center Service Expansion and Digital Transformation, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study that assesses the technical, financial, and commercial factors necessary to (i) establish five medical centers outside Nairobi, (ii) expand oncology and other services among existing facilities, specifically the Nairobi Hospital, through the procurement of advanced equipment, and (iii) upgrade Kenya Hospital Association&apos;s (KHA) IT systems throughout its network. The proposed grantee is the Kenya Hospital Association, a Kenyan hospital facility operator.</narrative>
  </description>
